
Maintenance Window Strategy
Rather than creating one maintenance window for every monitor, create them based on the same business hours.

Maintenance Window	Applies To	Operational Hours	Maintenance Active
MW-01	OPAS G2, Event Booking, LessonFlow, AMS SPTS	Monday-Friday 09:00-17:00 UK	Outside 09:00-17:00
MW-02	All GIS UMV	Monday-Friday 08:00-18:00 UK	Outside 08:00-18:00
MW-03	Gorilla, HUB	Monday-Friday 07:00-18:00 UK	Outside 07:00-18:00
MW-04	Delphi	Monday-Sunday 08:00-20:00 UK	Outside 08:00-20:00
This reduces administration and makes future maintenance much easier.

