Kibana Maintenance Window Design
Objective
The purpose of maintenance windows is to suppress alert notifications and incident creation during periods when applications are not expected to be available.

Synthetic monitors will continue executing, and data will continue to be stored in Elasticsearch. Only alert actions (email, Helix, ServiceNow, etc.) are suppressed.

