Kibana Configuration Steps
Navigate to Stack Management → Maintenance Windows.

Click Create maintenance window.

Enter the maintenance window name (for example, MW-BusinessHours-0900-1700).

Set the maintenance period to the non-operational hours.

Configure the recurrence (daily/weekly as appropriate).

Under Filters, paste the KQL for the relevant monitors.

Enable the maintenance window.

Repeat for the remaining maintenance windows.
